---
import PageHero from "../PageHero.astro";
import { pillSecondary, sectionLightGlow } from "../pageLayout";
import { SITE } from "../../site";

const effectiveYear = 2026;
---

<>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    subtitle="How we handle information you share when you contact us through our website."
    variant="atmosphere"
    size="large"
  />

  <section class={sectionLightGlow}>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-mb-ink/60">
        Effective {effectiveYear}. This policy describes {SITE.name}&apos;s practices for the contact
        form on this site. For other questions, email
        <a
          href="mailto:info@maslowsbridge.org"
          class="font-semibold text-mb-accent-solid underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
        >
          info@maslowsbridge.org
        </a>.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 space-y-12">
        <section id="collect" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">
            Information we collect
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>
              When you use the &quot;Contact us&quot; form, we ask for information so we can respond to you:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-mb-ink/88">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-mb-ink">Name</strong> — so we can address you respectfully in our reply.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-mb-ink">Email address</strong> — so we can write back to you (required).
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-mb-ink">Phone number</strong> — optional; only if you choose to provide it for follow-up by phone.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-mb-ink">Message</strong> — whatever you choose to tell us about your question, partnership idea, or need for support.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              We do not use the contact form to collect sensitive categories of data (such as health information) unless you voluntarily include that in your message. Please share only what you are comfortable with.
            </p>
            <p>
              Like most websites, our hosting provider may process standard technical data when you visit pages (for example, IP address, browser type, and request time) in server or security logs. We use that only to operate and protect the site, not for marketing profiling.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="use" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">How we use your information</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>We use what you submit solely for nonprofit operational purposes, including to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-mb-ink/88">
              <li>Read and reply to your inquiry;</li>
              <li>Coordinate follow-up with you by email or, if you provided it, by phone;</li>
              <li>
                Improve how we respond to common questions—without using your data for unrelated advertising.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              We do <strong class="text-mb-ink">not</strong> sell your personal information. We do
              <strong class="text-mb-ink">not</strong> use the contact form to build advertising profiles on other platforms.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="share" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">
            Sharing and service providers
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>
              We may share your submission with trusted service providers who help us run the website or email—such as web hosting, form delivery, or email—only as needed to transmit or store your message. They are expected to use your information only to perform those services for us and to protect it appropriately.
            </p>
            <p>
              We may also disclose information if required by law or to protect the safety, rights, or integrity of our organization, staff, or community.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="retention" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">How long we keep it</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>
              We retain contact form submissions long enough to respond and handle any related follow-up, and for a reasonable period afterward for record-keeping tied to community support and operations. When retention is no longer needed, we delete or de-identify the information, consistent with our internal practices and any legal obligations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="security" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">Security</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>
              We take reasonable steps to protect information submitted through our site against unauthorized access or disclosure. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure; if you have concerns about sensitive topics, consider calling or visiting us through channels we publish separately.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="rights" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">Your choices</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>
              Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, or request deletion of personal information we hold from your contact submission. To exercise those rights or ask what we have, email
              <a href="mailto:info@maslowsbridge.org" class="font-semibold text-mb-accent-solid underline-offset-2 hover:underline">
                info@maslowsbridge.org
              </a>. We will respond within a reasonable time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="children" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">Children</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>
              Our website is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children through the contact form. If you believe a child has submitted information, please contact us and we will take appropriate steps.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="changes" class="scroll-mt-28">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-mb-ink sm:text-2xl">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-[1.65] text-mb-ink/88 sm:text-[1.0625rem]">
            <p>
              We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the &quot;Effective&quot; date at the top of this page. Continued use of the contact form after changes means you accept the updated policy.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-4 border-t border-mb-mist/80 pt-10">
        <a href="/contact-us" class={pillSecondary}>Back to Contact</a>
        <a href="/" class={pillSecondary}>Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</>
